# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Safety first: this is a PUBLIC repo. Nothing project-specific may land here.
#
# The skill generates two kinds of file that describe a *user's own* codebase —
# schema names, table names, row counts. Those are the user's (or their
# client's) confidential data and must never be committed to this repo, even
# by accident while developing the skill itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated review reports (named <author>.sql-review.<date>.md)
*.sql-review.*.md

# Generated per-project rule layers
.sql-review/
*.local.md
project-rules.local.*

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
